  "description": "My mother’s desperate hands, the finish line and the medal I longed for. Hyun-Yeo’s love is never reciprocated. In a life filled with unrequited love, the one person she could rely on was Han Yo-Jun. When even he inevitably became the object of her desperate unrequited love, she could no longer bear it. Whether it’s reciprocated or rejected, she’s done with unrequited love once and for all. \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
